# text_id = 1569
# text = The Act of the United Kingdom , to which I referred the other day , was the Customs Act of 1886 , which prohibits , under Proclamation , the importation of all coins coined in any foreign country other than gold and silver coins ; I also quoted somewhat similar prohibitions which have been enforced in some of the Colonies .
