# text_id = 1579
# text = One of the many bills stuck on the walls said — " If you want free land vote for Arthur Arnold , " and I believe that the agricultural labourers of that constituency were steadily persuaded by the Radical candidate and his supporters that some measure could be brought into Parliament under which land could be freely given to them .
