# text_id = 1581
# text = The question of the details of the Home Rule Bill is of impor- tance in this Debate , for one reason and for one reason only , and that is , that until that Home Rule Bill receives some authoritative definition and explanation there is no justification for the alliance by which the present Government is to be expelled from power .
