# text_id = 1598
# text = On this occasion , the Loyalist minority actually acquiesced in the unanimous election of Daly , and if that fact stood alone , it ought to be a warning to the Government that in treating this demand of the people with the indifference and contempt which it had met with in the past , they would be acting very unwisely indeed .
