# text_id = 1604
# text = If the recommendations of the Tweedmouth Committee were carried into effect , it meant that a man for a small series of offences — perhaps for only one or two — might forfeit for a term of years 1s . per week of his salary , which might mean all the difference between comfort and discomfort for himself and his family .
