# text_id = 1607
# text = Another financial authority on the other side of the House , the honourable Member for Brixton ( Mr. Hubbard ) , said there was a danger to the country lest the anxiety of a Government to avoid the unpopularity involved in the proposal of new sources of taxation impelled them to a system of cowardly , niggardly , and paltry finance .
