# text = A calculation that he had made , he said , showed that in 1891 the total meat consumption of the country was 2,139,000 tons of food , and out of that 1,478,000 tons were produced at home , 489,000 tons of dead meat were imported from abroad , and only 172,000 tons of live imports wore brought into this country .
