# text_id = 1615
# text = THE LORD ADVOCATE ( Mr. J. P. B. ROBERTSON , Bute . ) : If by any bonâ fide disposition lands have been conveyed by a proprietor to another parson since the passing of the Crofters Act , I to not consider that such lands could be deemed available laud under the provisions of Section 13 of the Act .
