# text = I find in the Standard of September 28 — long before Kruger delivered his ultimatum — a statement to the effect that the news from native territories was well calculated to give pause to even the most adventurous spirits at Bloemfontein , for it was clear the natives near the Orange Free State were not likely to remain inactive spectators .
