# text = I think that shows that the trend of our fiscal policy during those four years has been to relieve the payers of indirect taxation , and therefore to relieve Ireland , which pays , as honourable Members well know , a considerably larger percentage of the indirect taxation of the United Kingdom than she does of the direct taxation .
