# text = He knew from personal experience that , in the populous county of Renfrew , which he had the honour to represent — a county with great centres of population , such as Glasgow and Paisley — the whole tendency during the century had been to consolidate farms , for it had been found difficult to carry on agriculture profitably otherwise .
