# text_id = 1673
# text = I strongly hold that every person not getting an income of £ 150 should not be called upon to pay , but , on the other hand , I do not think as Trade Unionists they should receive exceptional treatment to other citizens as to the funds they possess ; they must , with all other classes , be justly treated .
