# text_id = 1681
# text = Father Kinsella , in this quiet town , in this quiet county , having been so arrested and condemned , was taken to a railway station by an escort of dragoons , and when the people assembled at the station and peacefully cheered their departing pastor , the third baton charge of that week occurred , and many persons suffered injuries .
