# text_id = 1691
# text = Like vultures hovering over carrion , the Irish landlords smelt subscriptions from the public , and , while Professor Long and humane Englishmen and Irishmen and people in America are pouring out their subscriptions to save these people from starvation , the landlords hold their hands in order that , in a short time , they can pocket these subscriptions .
