# text_id = 1699
# text = The Constitutional provisions which the Americans had adopted , limiting the power of borrowing of any Local Authority to a certain percentage of the assessed value of the property within their area , had been found necessary in America , and most , valuable in producing increased economy ; and he was glad to see them introduced in this Bill .
