# text_id = 1700
# text = The principle is that every workman in the trades specified in this Measure will , in future , be entitled of right to moderate and reasonable compensation for all the accidents which may happen to bins in the course of the business in which he is engaged , unless those accidents are caused by his own gross and wilful default .
