# text = My right hon . Friend is aware of the severe conflict then going on , the pas- sions excited , and the dangers threatened , and that when a crisis became imminent the Leaders of the opposing Parties came together under the advice of sober counsels and concocted the system which was afterwards submitted to the House of Commons .
