# text_id = 1704
# text = To the representations of the Ambassadors the Porte replies that the pay of the gendarmes is so small that the engagement of foreigners would be almost impossible , and that , moreover , the only foreigners admissible [ rules ? ] would be Slavs of the Balkan States , but that among them the Montenegrins are extremely unpopular in Crete .
