# text_id = 1705
# text = He was pretty well acquainted with the work of the Home Office ; but while no one could doubt the enormous weight and responsibility of the functions discharged by the Home Secretary , he was bound to say , and he thought the Home Secretary would agree with him , that the Home Office was not necessarily an overworked Department .
