# text_id = 1708
# text = If the Irish landlords are to be condemned , surely , the English landlords equally deserve condemnation , for I find that in the East of England they had to reduce rents 30 , 40 , and even 60 per cent . , so that , apparently , they , too , had been demanding extortionate rents in good years .
