# text_id = 1711
# text = He feared that £ 30,000 was a very low estimate to make , on account of the delay in taking over the administration by the Government , and it would not cover expenditure in connection with petty wars ; but on the other hand , he thought the Under Secretary had by no means over - estimated the possible revenue .
