# text_id = 1724
# text = I admit that , while my right hon . Friend the Chancellor of the Exchequer has perfectly accurately represented the policy of the Government , if it had fallen to my lot as Chancellor of the Exchequer to carry out the same duty , there might , perhaps , be a slightly different colouring put upon his expression of opinion .
