# text_id = 1733
# text = I beg to ask the Attorney General for Ireland if the purchasers of land under the Land Purchase Bill will be granted a clean title from the Crown , all previous documents being withdrawn ; and if the holdings will be subsequently transferable by a system of registration similar to that in force in Australia under the Torrens Act ?
