# text_id = 1734
# text = We have no religious rancour amongst us in Ireland at present , and I challenge hon . Members opposite to point to one sentence that I or my friends have uttered which tended to religious animosity ; but is there anyone who blames us when we declare our intention to resist to the utmost such a state of affairs .
