# text_id = 1753
# text = For instance , an Amendment that was moved by the hon . Member for Mid Glamorgan was to the effect that if a clergyman was found guilty of treason or felony , or misdemeanour , and imprisoned for a period of not less than six months , with or without hard labour , his living should be ipso facto declared vacant .
