# text_id = 1755
# text = We are told by the right hon . Gentleman that we are bound to look at all the facts connected with a great movement — that we must look around and take a complete view of the whole of the social and political condition of Ireland when these crimes and outrages were committed in Ireland before we can regard what may have been done as a tit subject for Parliamentary censure .
