# text_id = 1759
# text = Unless the Government can give an assurance of a re-consideration of the Agreement as regards South Africa , or unless they can state , as I hope may be the case , with authority that the opinion of our fellow - subjects on the spot in South Africa cordially supports the Agreement , I fear that it will be impossible for me to vote for the Bill as it stands .
