# text_id = 1760
# text = I have had the opportunity lately of suggesting to the right hon . Gentleman that Famagusta should be a free port , so that merchants , instead of taking their goods to Beirut , where they have to pay very heavy customs duties , should bring them to Famagusta , where they would be able to draw from their stocks as orders came in from Asia Minor and Syria .
