# text_id = 1766
# text = In reply to a Petition signed by 7,000 or 8,000 of the inhabitants of Whitechapel , and the right hon . Gentleman wrote to me on June 17 expressing sympathy with the object of the petitioners , but he said the wharf was required for numerous and important military purposes ; but what are these purposes which prevent the public from using the wharf as they did in former times ?
