# text_id = 1770
# text = He sympathised with the Italian nation — a nation of old memories , of modern history , excellent in its way , but a nation which in the midst of the poverty of its own people had overtaxed itself for those warlike excursions , and which , as some might think in this country , had by bad generalship been overwhelmed with a catastrophe almost too difficult to paint in words .
