# text_id = 1772
# text = I hope it will not be open , after this Bill has passed , to any minority in Ireland to say , either in politics or religion , that when the Local Government Board carved the counties into divisions they did so in such a manner as to leave any minority without representation , which they could have given to them if their attention had been drawn to the matter .
