# text_id = 1773
# text = The old cry of " Annexation or death , " which used to figure at their interviews , has now ceased to be heard , and autonomy , involving the appointment of a European Governor , the cessation of all Turkish control in the internal administration of the island , and the ultimate withdrawal of the Turkish troops , is now more widely understood and more generally appreciated by them .
