# text_id = 1776
# text = It is not my intention to travel over again the ground of the hon . Gentleman opposite who has spoken in favour of this Bill , because my knowledge of vaccination is only limited to my own experience as a poor law guardian in the East End of London , and I am one of those guardians who absolutely refused to carry out the present Acts of Parliament dealing with vaccination .
