# text_id = 1777
# text = COLONEL KENYON - SLANEY ( Salop , Newport ) said many hon . Members on the Ministerial side had a friendly feeling towards the Amendment because , with the indulgence of the Treasury , it would keep in the hands of families who were not rich works of art which they cherished , and prevent them from being sold and getting into the hands of millionaires and other wealthy persons .
