# text = If he is going to take that line of argument , I may point out that , as a matter of fact , a large number of both officers and men who have suffered from blood poisoning in these barracks have been removed and put into private hospitals or in the Royal Infirmary , and there were two cases of soldiers suffering from lead poisoning in which death ensued .
