# text_id = 1782
# text = On the 6th April , in reply to representations made to us from India , we approved their reasons for not completing the Census before June last , and that , in accordance with that arrangement , Mr. Baynes would commence his " Moral and Material " Report when he got the information from India , which will not have been finished , in fact , until about this time .
