# text_id = 1787
# text = There is the commutation of a rate for the lump sum of £ 80,000 , the payment for which is spread over 30 years , and , as a matter of fact , the ratepayers , who at the end of 30 years ; will be quite free , will have been compelled to pay no more than they could have been compelled to pay for the next 300 years .
