# text_id = 1788
# text = The fact of the great disproportion between the taxation of Ireland and its taxable capacity compared with Great Britain — in other words , the fact that under our present system of taxation Ireland contributes more in proportion to her revenue in the form of taxes than the other portions of the kingdom — may , I think , now be looked upon as beyond all possibility of serious dispute .
