# text = But he would commend to the consideration of the Admiralty , with regard to the future development of the Navy , whether it would not be well to make our ships 100 feet broad , or 120 feet if they liked , if by making them so we could keep the enemy away from the vital portion of the ship and give ourselves the chance of winning a , great battle ?
