# text_id = 1790
# text = I understand that many of the workpeople have returned to work , and I have been hoping that the matter would be settled by mutual agreement ; if , however , this should fail , it may be necessary to have recourse to proceedings under the Track Act of last Session , which , for the first time gives the workers full protection against all unfair or unreasonable fines .
