# text_id = 1792
# text = God forbid that I should advocate that they should go out on strike ; I have never advocated a strike in my life ; but , while I think that if a man cannot get his just demands he is entitled to strike , I look for the time to come when these men will be able to get justice front this House , and strikes will be done away with .
