# text_id = 1794
# text = In France , in the large towns — Paris , Marseilles , and Lyons — the latter doctrines are rampant ; but outside the large towns those doctrines have not made a yard of progress , simply because they are met by millions of men with some property , who have that feeling which belongs to property , which I should like to see immensely increased in this country .
