# text_id = 1795
# text = It is not too much to expect that , if a man is paid a salary like this , he should do some tangible work for it , and I think that a sum of £ 750 a year is quite sufficient to give to a man who does such a small amount of work as that done by the Serjeant - at - Arms to the House of Lords .
