# text_id = 1797
# text = I hope and trust that , as far as England is concerned , the two per cent . is too low an estimate , and that at least three per cent . will be the increase ; and that , in virtue of having free education , there will be a greater increase in the attendance of children in England , and that you may arrive near to our Scotch estimate .
