# text_id = 1798
# text = I hope that the Government will not be deterred from doing its duty , but will see that the Act is administered in the spirit of the Circulars recently issued , and will not allow its beneficent object of dealing with a semi-criminal class to be defeated by extending its benefits to those the cost of providing for whom should fall not upon Imperial resources , but upon local rates .
