# text_id = 1799
# text = I am acquainted with most of the grand jurymen in almost every county , and I think it would be impossible to find a body of men in each of those counties who have devoted their time , their convenience , and in many cases their health , more heartily and more cordially to the interests and welfare of the county than the various grand jurymen in all parts of Ireland .
