# text_id = 1801
# text = Anyone on the Government Bench who follows me will not , I hope , omit to show that our apprehensions on this ground are ill - founded , and that there is no fear of the operation of the Bill putting a premium on the misconduct of public houses for the purpose of attracting the showers of gold which are to descend on this interest in the extinction of licences .
