# text_id = 1802
# text = My own conviction is — and I speak from what I have heard and also from personal experience — that long hours mean listless work , inefficient work , and even bad work , and that there is a maximum beyond which you cannot go with any efficiency in the labour , but that there is also a minimum beyond which you cannot go without increasing the cost of production .
