# text = There is no indisposition on the part of those on this side of the House to do what is fair and just to the police , but we are bound to remember that our public system of pension and superannuation is a very wide system , and that we shall have to deal with other interests than police interests if we grant exceptional privileges to that Department of the Public Service .
