# text = Why should that land not have half its rates paid , while the shopkeeper , the artisan , and the ordinary resident had not only to pay their rates in full , would not only receive no benefit from the Imperial contributions , but would , in the case of the rates being raised — as they must be raised by this Bill — have additional burdens thrown upon them ?
