# text_id = 1815
# text = If the question before the House was whether those Members who have been found guilty of offences should be punished or expelled from the House , then I could understand that the discussion might be a lengthened one ; but at present the whole thing appears to me to be a sham fight , and I protest against the time of private Members being taken in order to carry it on .
