# text_id = 1821
# text = There is general unanimity , I think , in the feeling that there should be some place for an aged member of the community who has done his duty in that state of life to which it has pleased God to call him — a place in which his career might have a more fitting termination than in the workhouse , which carries with it personal humiliation and political disqualification .
