# text = Now , all of us are painfully alive to those complications , and I can assure him , as chairman of a county committee , that I value his remarks , coming as they do from a representative of a great city in Scotland , more highly than I should do , Sir , if they were simply the expression of the opinion of a repre- sentative of a county .
