# text = You have sent the very best , or at all events the most conspicuous , men in the whole of your lofty line of British statesmen — the Duke of Wellington , Sir Robert Peel , Lord Melbourne , Lord Derby , and Lord Cardwell , and many others down — I will not mention anybody now in the House — to Lord Spencer and the present Duke of Devonshire .
