# text_id = 1826
# text = When they read an account of one of the new battleships or cruisers being launched , they were told that they were minutely subdivided , but on examination they discovered that all these minute sub -divisions were simply a network , or , in other words , that the subdivisions were run into each other , and were of such a nature that the doors must be constantly kept open .
