# text_id = 1829
# text = I believe that the oldest steam shipping company in existence is the Irish Steam Packet Company , which runs packet steamers from Holyhead to Kingstown , and if perpetual powers be given to the London and North Western Railway Company as asked for under this Bill , I think those powers will be used to crush out this old Irish company , and establish an absolute monopoly between London and Dublin .
