# text_id = 1830
# text = If this be so , I can see nothing unreasonable in the proposal that before this Bill is allowed to go before a Grand Committee a careful Memorandum should be prepared showing the changes it proposes to make in the existing law ; otherwise it would be extremely difficult for the Committee , at a brief notice , to pick out those questions which will require the greatest amount of consideration .
