# text = But whatever the detailed criticism of the hon . Member may be , his speech may fairly be claimed as in substance a speech in favour of the Second Reading of this Bill , and the hon . Gentleman appeared to have unconsciously arrived at that conclusion , judging by the fact that he was about to sit down after moving that the Bill be read a second time .
