# text = It was my duty in the House of Commons to take an active part in opposing the Bill in its entirety and in criticising its various clauses ; therefore , it would not be possible for me to - night , unless I admitted that I had changed my mind and the views I then deliberately expressed , to stand for ward as a supporter and defender of that Act .
