# text = The production of accounts by managers would tend to check any abuses that exist ; and he had very little doubt that , if the aid grant were properly administered through the associations , it would stimulate , rather that discourage , subscriptions , would encourage collective action where at present action was isolated , and would strengthen ill future that voluntary system he desired to see continuous and flourishing .
