# text = MR . DARLING , continuing , said that some other bookmaker might be , and the Bill seemed to him to have all the vices of a Bill introduced in favour of a particular class of litigants , and , that being so , it was obvious that it must fail to commend itself to many persons in the House , at all events on his side of the House .
