# text = It is not suggested that these Inspectors should visit or inspect machinery , nor , if there is any objection to it , that they should visit factories and workshops in the slums of Shoreditch or Whitechapel , or places of that sort ; but that they should visit workshops and factories in the great centres of our industry in which hundreds of women are often employed in one factory .
