# text = Many of us were deeply anxious that some provision , and effective provision , should be put into the Bill to secure the supremacy of the Imperial Parliament , but I do not believe that anybody in this House , to whatever Party he belongs — certainly not an Irish Nationalist — would desire to substitute for the supremacy of the Imperial Parliament the constant supervision of the Imperial Parliament .
