# text_id = 1849
# text = I will only say to my right hon . Friend , much as I admire many of his qualities , that when we , amongst whom he made his career , listen to his lectures to us for consistency in adhering to our opinions on Home Rule from which we have never deviated , we sometimes wish he would devote his attention to subjects more congenial to his great abilities .
