# text_id = 1850
# text = I can easily conceive circumstances which would justify Parliament interfering , as , for example , if the hours were oppressively long , if the workmen were incapable of protecting themselves , and if there was , I will not say a unanimous , but a very general desire for such protection , and if moreover the workmen had tried to do what they could for themselves and had failed .
