# text_id = 1851
# text = Regretful , sad , and distressed as we are that we should be brought into conflict with the Dutch in South Africa , yet , when we were confronted with this question as to whether the paramountcy , the predominance of British influence was to be for ever asserted in South Africa or not , there could be no hesitation or doubt as to the line the Government should take .
