# text_id = 1852
# text = Of course I do not deny that there have been landlords whose conduct I should be the last to defend , but they have always formed a small minority among the landlords of Ireland , and here today I claim for that body , as a whole , that whenever their conduct has been brought under the review of any fair and impartial tribunal they have passed through the ordeal scatheless .
