# text_id = 1853
# text = My noble Friend has told us that he has no intention of divulging before the time the Resolution which is to be the first act of this revolution ; but his reticence extends even beyond an unwillingness to give us the terms of the Resolution , for we have not heard from him an intimation as to the period of the Session in which this momentous Resolution is to be moved .
