# text = The firm say that their house having been for this long period of time a Non-union house , when they discovered that these 10 men belonged to the Typographical Association , and that they were agitating with the other men employed there , they , in their desire to continue this house as a Nonunion house , were driven to the necessity of giving notice to these 10 men .
