# text = I may remind the Committee that in the very same year Mr. Le Mesurier , who had been an official of the Government of Ceylon , and who had shown that he took a very deep interest in the welfare of the Cingalese , bought some of these lands which the Government claimed , in order to test whether the Crown had really or not a right to them .
