# text_id = 1857
# text = MR . DUNBAR BARTON ( Armagh , Mid . ) said , that if he might quote the words of the last speaker he would say that , as a superficial observer of modern Radical strategy , he had watched with interest the spectacle of the hon . Member for Northampton letting down buckets full of principle and drawing up buckets full of pious opinions from the inexhaustible wells of truth .
