# text_id = 1858
# text = We know very well the difference between the Quixotic cry for equality in matters which cannot be attained — for equality in the matter of wealth , for equality in the matter of intellect , and in everything that fortune and birth can give , and the equality which you can attain and which you ought to enforce in every department of State , and that is equality under the law .
