# text_id = 1860
# text = I still consider that that was a great political offence ; but suppose we had charged the noble Marquess with some moral crime in addition ; suppose we had produced some forged document , some sugar - loaf memorandum or something of that sort ; suppose we had produced that with the object of influencing Parliament , against him and then we had discovered that the document was forged .
