# text_id = 1862
# text = India is a long way from having what is called a Responsible Government , namely , an Administration composed of men who possess a majority in the Representative Assembly , and , therefore , Motions and Divisions in India would be more in the nature of discussions without any practical result , than in the nature of the practical business which alone ought to be carried on in the Legislative Assemblies .
