# text = Last year , on the occasion of the Debate on Mr. Morley 's Bill , Mr. T. W. Russell said — This question of occupation right was fully discussed in the House of Commons and in the House of Lords during ' the consideration of the Act of 1881 , and it was never intended that this question of occupation right should he considered in estimating a fair rent .
