# text_id = 1865
# text = I do not think the learned Solicitor General and the Attorney General are really right in their contention that these words are required , as the effect will be precisely the same whether the clause is or is not adopted ; and , if so , is it not a pity to put into the Bill a clause to the effect that you can ask the prisoner to incriminate himself ?
