# text = I believe I am correct in saying that this Report was practically drawn by the hon . Member for Lincolnshire himself , and I therefore did expect , when he rose to present this Bill to the House , that I should have heard some explanation why these very important matters to which attention has been called elsewhere have been dropped out of the scheme now before the House .
