# text = It was no fault of the local authorities or of the people that those gentlemen did not occupy the positions which might be expected of them , for the Irish people , who were a Conservative people in the broadest sense of the word , would be only too ready to welcome and respect them in those positions of leading and responsibility which their opportunities enabled them to fill .
