# text_id = 1869
# text = I am delighted that the right hon . Gentleman has , in the matter of the depletion of stores , taken the bull by the horns , and that in future stores will not be depleted in times of economy , but that the country will have a full and effective supply , that the stores will be examined , and a correct Report made regarding them year by year .
