# text_id = 1870
# text = I believe that unpatriotic shipowners who carry the mails and the Government transport ought to give preference to British sailors , and not always show the preference they do to the lascar or the coolie , who is employed , first , because he is cheap , and , secondly , because he can be bullied and dominated to an extent that the English sailor will not submit to .
