# text_id = 1875
# text = It was a very frequent practice now to have two executors , one to deal with the property in this country and the other to deal with the property in foreign countries or the colonies , and the Amendment proposed to enable the executor to deal with the property in this country , and to disassociate himself from any interference with the property on the other side of the world .
