# text_id = 1879
# text = Perhaps , however , it would meet his views if , before the Supreme Court Estimate is discussed , there is laid on the Table a statement of what has been done , and what remains to be done , to carry out the recommendations of former Committees presided over by the Lord Chief Justice and the Master of the Rolls , which were referred to in the debates of 1888 .
