# text = The result of this was that a certain number who had entered the Service on the faith of the existing Regulations , and who looked forward , by their good conduct and the exercise of their abilities , to pushing themselves into the position of commissioned officers , were shut out from the prospects which had , probably , induced them to enter the Service by the passing of this Rule .
