# text_id = 1882
# text = With regard to the Returns - which my noble Friend asks for , I can only say that , as far as my Department is concerned , we are quite prepared to give them , and , so far as I understand , the other Departments are also prepared to do so , with a slight alteration which has been suggested , and which my noble Friend has acceded to .
