# text = The hon . Member for the University of Glasgow stated that this question had already been decided several times by this House It is quite true that the question was decided adversely to us last year , but it should be remembered that the decision come to was against the weight of Scotch opinion , and that the majority of the Scotch Members supported the principle of this Amendment .
