# text_id = 1886
# text = A colliery belonging to him had been working since the Act was passed with all those advantages which the late Home Secretary desired they should have , they had been able to contract out or not as they liked , most of them had not contracted out , and there had been , he believed , but one case — a mere bagatelle — from that time to this .
