# text_id = 1888
# text = It might be that ; but considering that the City of London had not confined the advantages of its great wealth to its own area , but hail expended that wealth in ways by which places lying outside its boundaries had greatly advantaged , it was an ungracious thing to attempt to refuse , to those who desired it , the opportunity of associating themselves with the City id London .
