# text = On behalf of the hon . Member for the Central Division of Sheffield ( Colonel HOWARD VINCENT ) , I beg to ask the President of the Board of Agriculture how many prosecutions have been undertaken by the Board of Agriculture under the Merchandise Marks Prosecutions Act , 1894 , in respect of the false marking of agricultural or horticultural produce ; and in how many were convictions obtained ?
