# text_id = 1895
# text = Even if such reasons existed they would be entirely inapplicable , because no one dare advocate the employment of men , women , and children under unreasonable conditions , even to make a trade profitable , which otherwise would not be so ; but , as a matter of fact , it is so profitable that the trade of cotton - spinning in India has been increasing by leaps and bounds .
