# text_id = 1897
# text = I speak from sad personal experience , for during the last six years I have striven to get a hearing for the Indian view of Indian affairs , but in no case have I been able to obtain independent inquiry into any complaint , nor the redress of any Indian grievance , whether that grievance is suffered by an individual , by a class , or by the whole Indian people .
