# text = I pass to the more general part of the speech of the hon . Gentleman , which followed on the lines previously recapitulated by another hon . Gentleman last night , and turned in the main on the increased cost of the Police Force during the last 50 or 60 years , during which he is quite correct in saying the population of Ireland has undergone a large diminution .
