# text = Although this was in one sense a Private Bill , in so far as it affected private taxation , yet it dealt with a matter of general public interest , and involved an alteration of a great public principle ; and it seemed to him , therefore , to be very inconvenient that no explanation had been given hon . Members of the grounds upon which it had been brought forward .
