# text_id = 1909
# text = If they attempted to mend this Bill in Committee they should be told , in the first place , that they must regard the Budget as a whole ; and , in the second place , that they should be merely postponing the inconveniences which must arise from the collapse of this measure — which he regarded as inevitable — to a period when they would be still more inconvenient .
