# text_id = 1910
# text = This Bill was but the precursor of many Bills of a similar type that were to follow until they were all hard - bound in Atlantic or Arctic ice ; and instead of having free play to work out their own salvation , subject only to the limitations which human kindness imposed upon them , they would be in a position which he for one should not desire to see .
