# text = I think the right honourable Gentleman the President of the Board of Trade , when he analyses his own scheme , will acknowledge that he has been misled by the information of the Board of Trade officials — who ought to know better — and he will see also that it is doomed to failure , and had better be withdrawn , and something more substantial put in its place .
