# text = The measure has been introduced , as the noble Earl has said , on behalf of certain ladies who have been elected to the London County Council , and though I have , on behalf of the Government , to ask your Lordships not to support this Bill , I should be very sorry to say a single word which would imply any want of courtesy or respect for those ladies .
