# text_id = 1914
# text = Considering the statements made , both inside and outside the House , during the last 20 years , considering the statements made by speakers from Ireland with regard to England and the English people , it was not to be wondered at that the constituencies of England would strongly resent the idea of English money going into the Irish poekots — especially if I he partnership was to be dissolved .
