# text_id = 1917
# text = If the right hon . Gentleman did not pluck up courage next year to make these proposals , it would be the duty of them not only to oppose his Estimates , but even to vote against the Budget or some financial proposal of a Chancellor of the Exchequer who would not find money for such necessary improvements , which would be made at once in any capital of the Continent .
