# text = May I ask the Prime Minister whether , as this Bill is to carry out an international engagement , and could be carried in a few minutes , seeing that it is identical with a measure already on the Statute Book , and seeing that England is the only Power which has not passed legislation in pursuance of the international arrangement , he will give facilities for its passage ?
