# text = I realise the true cause , and if hon . Members would take care not to allow articles to be sent into this country to compete with our produce , they would confer an enormous benefit on the community ; you would hear no more of the tithe rent - charge difficulty , and you would find the National Church of this country in a very happy and contented state .
