# text = THE SECRETARY TO THE ADMIRALTY ( Mr. W. G. E. MACARTNEY , Antrim , S. ) : With regard to the last question raised by my noble and gallant Friend relative to the savings , I think it will be more convenient to the Committee if I hold that over until we go to Vote 2 , upon which the money is taken with regard to that special saving .
