# text_id = 1925
# text = The Water Company would not waste the money , but would spend it properly in improving the service of water to the consumers , and there was no reason why the London County Council , if they thought fit , should not appear before the Committee and have a clause inserted in the Bill giving them some representation , so that they might see that the money was expended properly .
